现在写类型文件。要覆盖：
- api.ts: PageResult, ApiErrorBody, ApiErrorCode
- auth.ts: User, AuthTokens, LoginRequest, RegisterRequest
- conversation.ts: Conversation, MessageAttachment, Citation, MessageArtifact, Capabilities, Usage, ChatMessage (maybe in chat.ts)
- chat.ts: ChatEventName, ChatStreamRequest, ChatStreamHandlers, SSE event data types
- run.ts: Run, RunEvent, RunStatus, Pending
- approval.ts
- agent.ts
- task.ts
- knowledge.ts
- workflow.ts
- system.ts

需要设计前端视图模型。chat store 的消息与过程条目。可以在 types/chat.ts 中定义 `ChatMessage`（API 消息）与 `TimelineItem`（前端）。

为了避免过度设计，先定义契约类型 + 少量前端视图类型（在 store 里）。

SSE 事件 data 类型：
```
interface BaseEventData { run_id?: string; ts?: string; seq?: number }
interface RunStartedData extends BaseEventData { run_id: string; conversation_id: string; ... }
...
type ChatEventPayloadMap = { 'run.started': RunStartedData; ... }
```
这样 reducer 可以按事件名收窄。定义完整的 map 覆盖 4.4 节事件。这是核心。

写文件。注意 TS 严格模式与 noUncheckedIndexedAccess。

类型设计：

api.ts:
```ts
export interface PageStats { [key: string]: number }
export interface PageResult<T> {
  items: T[]
  next_cursor: string | null
  has_more: boolean
  stats?: PageStats
}
export interface ApiErrorBody { error: { code: string; message: string; request_id: string } }
export interface CursorParams { limit?: number; cursor?: string }
```

auth.ts:
```ts
export type UserRole = 'user' | 'admin'
export type UserStatus = 'active' | 'disabled'
export interface User { ... last_login_at: string | null }
export interface AuthTokens { access_token; refresh_token; token_type: 'bearer'; expires_in: number }
export interface LoginRequest { email; password }
export interface RegisterRequest { email; password; display_name }
```

conversation.ts:
```ts
export type ConversationStatus = 'active' | 'archived'
export interface Conversation { ... }
export interface ConversationDetail extends Conversation { archived_at: string | null; last_run: LastRun | null }
export interface Citation { index; document_id; chunk_id; title; category; score; updated_at }
export interface MessageAttachment { id; filename; mime_type; size_bytes }
export interface MessageArtifact { id; name; mime_type; size_bytes; kind; content?: string | null; download_url?: string | null; metadata?: Record<string, unknown> }
export interface MessageCapabilities { skills: string[]; mcp_servers: string[]; mcp_tools: string[]; knowledge_categories: string[]; workflow_id?: string | null }
export interface Usage { input_tokens; output_tokens; reasoning_tokens?; total_tokens? }
export interface MessageError { code; message }
export type MessageStatus = 'completed' | 'failed' | 'canceled'
export interface Message { id; role; content; content_type; run_id; client_message_id; status; citations; attachments; capabilities; artifacts; usage; error; created_at; metadata? }
```
注意 ChatMessage 在契约里叫 messages。用 `Message` 更贴近 API，前端视图 `ChatMessage` 在 chat.ts。

chat.ts:
```ts
export type ChatEventName = ...
export interface ChatStreamRequest ...
export interface BaseEvent { run_id?: string; ts?: string; seq?: number }
export interface ConversationCreatedData ...
...
export type ChatEventDataMap = {...}
export type ChatEventData<K extends ChatEventName> = ChatEventDataMap[K]
export interface StreamHandlers { onOpen?; onEvent: (event: ChatEventName, data: unknown) => void; onError; signal: AbortSignal }
```
onEvent data 用 unknown 由 reducer 收窄。也可以泛型 `onEvent<K>` 但运行时统一 unknown 更容易。

前端时间线类型：
```ts
export type ProcessKind = 'reasoning' | 'skill' | 'tool' | 'a2a' | 'approval' | 'workflow' | 'notice' | 'error'
export interface ProcessItem { id; kind; status; title; ... }
export interface ChatTurn { ... }
```
这些放 `src/types/chat-view.ts` 或 store 里。为了 reducer 可测，定义在 types/chat.ts：
```ts
export interface ChatMessageView extends Message { streaming?: boolean; reasoning?: ReasoningView }
export interface ProcessItem { id: string; kind: ProcessKind; status: 'running'|'ok'|'error'|'waiting'|'skipped'; title: string; subtitle?: string; ...; payload?: Record<string, unknown> }
```
但具体字段因卡片而异。用判别联合更严谨：
```ts
export type ProcessItem =
  | { kind: 'reasoning'; ... }
  | { kind: 'skill'; ... }
```
这会让 reducer 复杂。先用统一结构 + `data` 字段，卡片组件按 kind 读取已知字段。可接受但类型弱。

更好：判别联合，每种卡片类型定义具体字段。工作量稍大但 reducer 清晰。

定义：
```ts
interface ProcessBase { id: string; status: ProcessStatus; startedAt?: string; durationMs?: number | null }
export interface ReasoningItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'reasoning'; content: string; tokens?: number | null; done?: boolean }
export interface SkillItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'skill'; skillId: string; slug: string; name: string; scope?: string; description?: string; estimatedTokens?: number }
export interface ToolItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'tool'; toolCallId: string; tool: string; displayName: string; source?: string; argsPreview?: string; resultPreview?: string; error?: string | null; metadata?: Record<string, unknown> }
export interface A2aItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'a2a'; taskId: string; a2aTaskId?: string; agent: string; agentName?: string; state: string; progress?: number | null; requestSummary?: string; resultSummary?: string; error?: string | null; artifactSummary?: string }
export interface ApprovalItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'approval'; approvalId: string; toolName: string; toolDisplayName?: string; source?: string; executor?: string; target?: string; sideEffect?: string; risk?: string; reason?: string; expiresAt?: string | null; decision?: 'approve'|'reject'|null }
export interface WorkflowStepItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'workflow'; workflowId: string; stepIndex: number; stepType: string; name: string }
export interface NoticeItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'notice'; level: string; code: string; message: string; retryable?: boolean }
export interface ErrorItem extends ProcessBase { kind: 'error'; code: string; message: string }
export type ProcessItem = ...
```

ChatState：
```ts
export interface ChatState {
  conversationId: string | null
  conversationTitle: string
  messages: ChatMessageView[]
  process: ProcessItem[]  // 当前 run 的过程，按顺序
  streaming: boolean
  runId: string | null
  pendingApproval: ApprovalItem | null
  error: MessageError | null
  usage: Usage | null
  lastSeq: number
  finishReason: string | null
}
```
Process 全局顺序（跨消息）足够 M1；每个 assistant 消息的 process 绑定到当前 turn。简化：process 是当前 run 的列表，消息气泡展示正文，过程区展示 process。历史消息加载时没有 process（历史 API 不含事件），只显示正文与引用。可接受。

`ChatMessageView` 扩展 Message：
```ts
export interface ChatMessageView extends Message {
  streaming?: boolean
  reasoning?: { content: string; duration_ms?: number | null; tokens?: number | null; done?: boolean }
}
```
但 Message.role 等必填，乐观消息需要临时 id。可以构造完整对象。

